flowchart TB
    accTitle: The agent harness
    accDescr: Preparation guides the agent; observation feeds back into the work and the map. Finished changes pass deterministic checks and receive a separate Jev review.
    map["1. Prepare<br/>AGENTS.md, slice map and guides"]:::input
    work["2. Work<br/>Agent reads and edits one slice"]:::process
    observe["3. Observe<br/>Heimdall records tool activity"]:::process
    feedback["4. Give feedback<br/>Boundary warnings and drift report"]:::decision
    checks["5. Verify<br/>Tests, Eitri and Brokkr canaries"]:::process
    review["6. Review<br/>Jev answers typed questions<br/>Policy determines the outcome"]:::output
    map --> work
    work --> observe --> feedback
    feedback -.->|Adjust the next action| work
    feedback -.->|Persistent drift: reconsider boundaries| map
    work -->|Finished change| checks
    checks -->|Checks pass| review
    classDef input fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554
    classDef process fill:#f0fdfa,stroke:#0f766e,color:#134e4a
    classDef decision fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f
    classDef output fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
